Package: geo-split
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ald
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, geo-split-data, ip-full, curl, bind-dig
Recommends: jq
Description: Split routing by GeoIP subnets and domain lists for Keenetic/Entware.
 Route traffic through different network interfaces based on country IP zones
 and curated domain lists. Supports bypass, vpn, and auto modes.
 Uses ip rule + ip route (no iptables fwmark) for Keenetic NDM compatibility.
Section: net
Priority: optional
